Measurement output

Committed experiment output also quotes the corpora it measured. Short
excerpts of markdown appear in experiments/D8-identity/results-*.txt.
Formulas, header text and sheet names from two spreadsheet corpora appear in
the files below, which are therefore licensed as the corpus they quote
requires, not as MIT. No committed file quotes EUSES or VFUSE: W3-interop
could not read their legacy .xls formulas (design-findings/W3-interop.md 1.2).

